    "images-with-text-scroll": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scroll",
      "blocks": {
        "step-materials": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CORVO_FINAL-19.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Raw materials",
            "content": "<p>In the world of high-end luxury rugs, the difference between good and extraordinary begins with material. At Corvo, we take time with this choice. Every fiber is selected for how it feels, how it wears over time, and how it lives in a space, not just how it looks.</p><p>We work with a wide range of exceptional fibers, from refined plant-based yarns and fine cottons to natural wools chosen for their strength and comfort. Each rug is built as a balanced composition, where texture, weight, and light come together naturally. </p>",
            "link_text": "Raw materials",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/raw-materials",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "step-colours": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CORVO_FINAL-22.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Colours",
            "content": "<p>Choose from our Open Palette or develop a tone of your own through Infinite Colours. In our colour laboratory every hue is engineered, and every batch of yarn is tested in-house for colourfastness and consistency.</p>",
            "link_text": "Colours",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/colours",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "step-service": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-05_at_20.18.57_4.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Service",
            "content": "<p>It starts with a personal consultation, where our team works with you on fibres, structure, pile height, colours and shape. Then come the artwork for your approval, a sample, production and delivery.</p>",
            "link_text": "Our service",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/bespoke-service",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "step-materials",
        "step-colours",
        "step-service"
      ],
