        "subheading": "The atelier",
        "title": "Real people, real craft",
        "content": "<p>Corvo is the production atelier of the Sorema group, working alongside our premium mill in Portugal. Every rug passes through the hands of the people who make it: people, not production lines.</p><p>From the first sketch to the choice of yarn and the final hand-finishing, each stage is overseen in-house, so we know where every piece comes from and who made it.</p>",
